# Venture Cornerstone — Operator-Private Zone patterns (see CONTRIBUTING.md § Content zones)

# Operator profile — never tracked, never auto-inferred (P7)
_USER.md

# Per-cartridge working state and private logs (operator's active work)
*/Sessions/
*/_design-state.md
*/_source-log.md

# Shipped Examples carve-out: Example-Business-* cartridges are release-owned
# reference implementations and ship IN FULL — re-include the working files the
# operator-private patterns above would otherwise ignore.
!Example-Business-*/Sessions/
!Example-Business-*/_design-state.md
!Example-Business-*/_source-log.md

# Packaged-cartridge note: a cartridge closed out per _venture-cornerstone-engine/06-CLOSE-OUT.md
# nests its history under <Business>/Records/, which the single-level patterns above do not
# match — a packaged cartridge (e.g. Example-Business-Tendly) ships fully tracked by design.

# Filesystem / workspace noise
.DS_Store
.obsidian/

# NOTE: the Grows-Through-Use Zone (_portfolio/failure-catalog.md and
# _portfolio/benchmark-library.md) is intentionally NOT ignored — it ships seeded
# and is merge-updated, not clobbered, on git pull.
